# Every installed leetplus-* service/timer must be classified. DRAIN entries
# are stopped and disabled after the scheduler-free pair is publicly serving.
# SAFE entries may remain loaded. REQUIRED entries must exist; OPTIONAL ones
# may be absent but, when present, are still drained.
REQUIRED_DRAIN leetplus-api.service
REQUIRED_DRAIN leetplus-web.service
REQUIRED_DRAIN leetplus-deploy.timer
OPTIONAL_DRAIN leetplus-deploy.service
OPTIONAL_DRAIN leetplus-guest-game-bot-consumer.timer
OPTIONAL_DRAIN leetplus-guest-game-bot-consumer.service
SAFE leetplus-api-rollback@.service
SAFE leetplus-web-rollback@.service
SAFE leetplus-api-rollback@7de04ff4ccc814494810730be3fa6bf661097b07.service
SAFE leetplus-web-rollback@7de04ff4ccc814494810730be3fa6bf661097b07.service
SAFE leetplus-rollback-egress.service
SAFE leetplus-api@.service
SAFE leetplus-web@.service
SAFE leetplus-api@blue.service
SAFE leetplus-web@blue.service
SAFE leetplus-api@green.service
SAFE leetplus-web@green.service
SAFE leetplus-release-hydrate@.service
SAFE leetplus-release-hydrate@7de04ff4ccc814494810730be3fa6bf661097b07.service
SAFE leetplus-blue-green-recovery.service
SAFE leetplus-blue-green-recovery-watchdog.service
SAFE leetplus-blue-green-recovery.timer
